    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a regular worker. After work, you are heading home, but you fell asleep in metro and when you wake up you find yourself in an empty small town. You are faced with a demonic monster and have to find a way to escape this little town and go home safely.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ominous atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard to predict jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable Enemy AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short heart pounding playtime</strong><br><br><i>WASD for movement<br>&quot;C&quot; for Camera <br>CTRL for crouching</i></p>",
